#1214 (ownership-v2.md §2.8 *The holder index*, *Verdicts*): the holder index's canonical order, with v1's verdicts. Where v1 names a hold met first, v2 names the first in the order: an exact hold before an approximate one (`earlyLate`'s `late.list`, v1 `early[*]`; `withinOne`'s `holder.z`, v1 `holder.a[*]`), and `joinAlt`'s base of two cells is an approximate `element` refusal (v1: an exact `alias`).
